xscreensaver-matrixcode for Debian and Ubuntu
=============================================

This package is intentionally separate from the upstream xscreensaver source
package. It installs one additional hack and the metadata needed for
xscreensaver-settings:

  /usr/libexec/xscreensaver/matrixcode
  /usr/share/xscreensaver/config/matrixcode.xml
  /usr/share/applications/screensavers/matrixcode.desktop
  /usr/share/man/man6/matrixcode.6x

Restart xscreensaver-settings after installation. If MatrixCode does not appear
immediately, close all settings windows and launch xscreensaver-settings again.

The renderer requires X11 and GLX. It is not a Wayland-native screen saver.
